            "meaning": "特别的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "People become quite illogical when they try to decide what can be eaten and what cannot be eaten.",
      "translation": "在决定什么能吃、什么不能吃的时候，人们变得很不讲逻辑。",
      "startTime": 20.29,
      "endTime": 28.5,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "illogical",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "不合逻辑的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "If you lived in the Mediterranean, for instance, you would consider octopus a great delicacy.",
      "translation": "例如，如果你住在地中海地区，你会把章鱼视作美味佳肴。",
      "startTime": 28.51,
      "endTime": 35.91,
